	('14ee3e38-5f96-4122-a1e6-75044cc0f3d9', NULL, NULL, '*Bug* Multiple trackers created at once', '<p>After making a work tracker and hitting send, it creates 3 of the same trackers on that bleacher.</p>', 'completed', 0, true, NULL, 'fae8f510-96d3-4437-b184-45be5c4b7007', '2026-06-23 16:54:35.067+00', '2026-09-04 19:48:30.867993+00', NULL),
	('907b8363-0091-47dc-91d0-7978a54c0a18', '9c22d49d-dbb9-4b24-9175-666edd58b4c2', NULL, 'Setup DMARK in Postmark for email deliverability', '<p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://account.postmarkapp.com/signature_domains/4597680">https://account.postmarkapp.com/signature_domains/4597680</a></p>', 'completed', 0, false, '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-06-17 17:48:18.887+00', '2026-08-27 15:06:23.739932+00', NULL),
	('6801678d-a111-4c91-9439-ec714f74d491', 'd3056243-c26f-4f7c-ba49-92b608ac8a61', NULL, 'Filter out Deactivated Accounts for Drop Downs', '<p>I''ve noticed there''s a bunch of drop downs that we made very quickly that don''t filter out people who were marked as "Deactivated" in the DB. Please add a filter to the following lists:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Assigned developer </strong>in this very modal</p></li><li><p><strong>Assign Drivers</strong> in the Account manager tab in team page</p></li><li><p><strong>Account Managers &amp; Drivers</strong> in Zones page</p></li><li><p>anywhere else you can find a list of people selected.</p></li><li><p>Make sure bleachers that are soft-deleted are filtered out as well please</p></li></ul><p></p><p></p>', 'completed', 0, false, '43f82f56-f6e2-4400-aeb2-7c5195c557ad', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-06-23 14:41:17.94+00', '2026-06-24 20:23:14.252366+00', NULL),
	('24dc3948-5835-4b49-bf9c-0dfc4fb94e9e', NULL, NULL, 'Quote creating request', '<p>automatically have the larger bleacher type at the top of the line item,  Have an expense filed under each bleacher type for delivery/set-up charge,  this charge is marked hidden but can be marked visible by the account manager, </p><p></p><p></p>', 'to_do', 0, true, NULL, '6b080032-c889-4ce5-86e0-5a564a4d97f7', '2026-06-25 11:14:24.024+00', NULL, NULL),
	('be5f1593-2c6b-47df-8c69-3c125203e594', NULL, NULL, 'Import contact list', '<p>Impor the contact list and venue list from goodshuffle for quick filling the quote page</p>', 'to_do', 0, true, NULL, '6b080032-c889-4ce5-86e0-5a564a4d97f7', '2026-06-25 11:15:40.66+00', NULL, NULL),
	('371a107d-90a1-4d93-8c6f-e0d88a8283d8', NULL, NULL, 'Work tracker update', '<p>Have total hours expected and total hauling miles on each trip of a work tracker, </p><p>Total hours = hauling miles * 1.2 Plus Deadhead miles(= hauling miles but empty)</p><p></p><p>This Should help us optimize drivers weeks by letting us know how many hours are expected each day and each week.  </p>', 'to_do', 0, true, NULL, '6b080032-c889-4ce5-86e0-5a564a4d97f7', '2026-06-25 11:18:25.136+00', NULL, NULL),
	('d7c96477-9497-4795-bd68-4ca10fcbf8b1', NULL, NULL, 'Duplicate trips,', '<p>Once a trip is create, the option to dublicate it should be available,   with a copy, and paste feature.  </p>', 'to_do', 0, true, NULL, '6b080032-c889-4ce5-86e0-5a564a4d97f7', '2026-06-25 11:30:56.456+00', NULL, NULL),
	('fd9f1aa3-93f7-4de8-9b6c-b61edccc88ff', NULL, NULL, 'work tracker alerts,', '<p>Pick up adress not matching alerts shows up when we drag a trip into the future,  yet the adress is still correct. </p>', 'to_do', 0, true, NULL, '6b080032-c889-4ce5-86e0-5a564a4d97f7', '2026-06-25 11:37:08.37+00', NULL, NULL),
	('e46918cf-b748-4572-b21e-b6ecd2c3b49e', NULL, NULL, 'Trip pop up window', '<p>Create a detailed pay section, sections include</p><p>Set-up/ tear down fee. ($100/15 row) or $50/7/10 row) or $25/4 row</p><p>Dead head miles, $1/ mile shown on the hauling miles)</p><p>Hauling milage pay (= drivers pay rate minus $1/mile)</p><p>Cleaning fee ($100/ 15 row, $75/ 10 row, $50/ 7 row) checkbox created,</p><p>Other (this should be the only editable section, +/- other amounts, description can be in the notes section.</p><p>Hotel/perdium, also a checkbox, (autofilled with $200). any runs over 6 hours should auto select this box , but it account managers shoul dbe ableto de-select</p><p></p><p>Work tracker type to remove.</p><p>Cleaning, tear down, set-up, dead head. hotel/perdium,</p><p></p>', 'to_do', 0, true, NULL, '6b080032-c889-4ce5-86e0-5a564a4d97f7', '2026-06-25 11:28:30.715+00', NULL, NULL),
	('2b92917c-6556-43eb-a04e-4102a546ef38', NULL, NULL, 'Events be in multiple zones without subrental?', '<p>Should we Allow Events to have Bleachers Assigned from different zones without a subrental?</p>', 'to_do', 0, true, NULL, '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-06-25 14:28:07.312+00', NULL, NULL),
	('d0550e83-dbfe-4356-b50f-411758dc6e51', NULL, NULL, 'Tax Exempt Button', '<p>Events/Quotes should be marked as tax exempt which means no tax, then prompt the customer to upload themselves when signing quote.</p>', 'to_do', 0, true, NULL, '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-06-25 15:28:21.548+00', NULL, NULL),
	('5bdc4b08-26ce-4748-a6f0-9e6955d279cf', 'd3056243-c26f-4f7c-ba49-92b608ac8a61', NULL, 'Automatic insertion of the clerk ID into the database', '<p>just found a new bug with inviting a user. When they create an account clerk should send a webhook to src/app/api/webhooks to insert the clerk user id in the users table and it''s not in production. so when a new account gets created I manually need to go to clerk find the user and copy the id into the Users table.... could you figure out how to get ngrok working for inviting new accounts locally? remember you can make as many new accounts as you want with <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="mailto:max+1@bleacherrentals.com">max+1@bleacherrentals.com</a> or max+2 etc.</p>', 'completed', 0, false, '43f82f56-f6e2-4400-aeb2-7c5195c557ad', '43f82f56-f6e2-4400-aeb2-7c5195c557ad', '2026-06-26 15:38:44.882+00', '2026-06-30 20:02:49.511001+00', NULL),
	('d75dd145-05f4-419e-9b2d-9184f2b6344d', NULL, NULL, 'Measure response rate for things like backlog tickets and phone calls etc', '<p></p>', 'to_do', 0, true, NULL, '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-06-25 18:52:54.643+00', NULL, NULL),
	('a1fea1d7-4f64-43f6-9125-1ee6a1fb76eb', NULL, NULL, 'Come up with software Measureables', '<ul><li><p>need to come to quarterly meeting with 2-3 measureables</p></li><li><p>driver satisfaction score could be a mobile app feature.</p></li><li><p>maybe a web app feature too</p></li><li><p>Number of backlog tickets completed</p></li><li><p>story points completed add story points to tickets.</p></li></ul><p></p>', 'completed', 0, true, '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-06-25 19:07:30.341+00', '2026-06-25 19:34:27.28457+00', NULL),
	('11371467-006f-4337-a3ad-e33035804c2b', NULL, NULL, 'Driver Satisfaction Score', '<p>Driver satisfaction page where drivers feel like they have a notification that they need to get rid of. When they submit a review, then the notification goes away. That''s the future idea, and then also maybe drivers can submit backlog tickets. </p>', 'to_do', 0, true, NULL, '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-06-25 19:35:35.695+00', NULL, NULL),
	('3e10c6ce-7377-471d-b111-b68a9020eb42', NULL, NULL, 'Drivers Can Submit Backlog tickets', '<p></p>', 'to_do', 0, true, NULL, '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-06-25 19:35:57.461+00', NULL, NULL),
