	('a2842db9-6c74-4cca-be1d-654b05f3227a', '438f4c13-7bbf-4dbf-bc85-ee6f86d02bbb', NULL, 'Create PR for Internal Messaging', '<p>I think you have the internal messaging feature somewhere and it needs to be pushed to production so we don''t forget about it. Can you test it and make a PR please?</p>', 'completed', 0, false, '43f82f56-f6e2-4400-aeb2-7c5195c557ad', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-07-20 20:39:19.327+00', '2026-07-21 14:00:56.831616+00', NULL),
	('7fa623e9-6f71-4f27-ba0d-6e591aa7abcd', '438f4c13-7bbf-4dbf-bc85-ee6f86d02bbb', NULL, 'Driver App - No More Bleacher Selection', '<p>remove the ability to select another bleacher from the driver app.</p>', 'completed', 0, false, '43f82f56-f6e2-4400-aeb2-7c5195c557ad', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-07-20 20:05:45.442+00', '2026-07-23 15:37:46.422093+00', NULL),
	('8e52aa2f-9237-4064-8336-c22ac521f61d', '438f4c13-7bbf-4dbf-bc85-ee6f86d02bbb', NULL, 'Driver App First Log In Messaging', '<p>When the driver first signs into the mobile application the initial message says "Can''t Find Your Account" and eventually updates to show them their trips but can take a while if they have poor internet connection.</p><p></p><p>Josh</p>', 'completed', 0, true, '43f82f56-f6e2-4400-aeb2-7c5195c557ad', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-06-30 16:55:25.241+00', '2026-07-27 12:37:15.385885+00', NULL),
	('d7533b6d-53fa-4557-9f95-6854d4212a73', '438f4c13-7bbf-4dbf-bc85-ee6f86d02bbb', NULL, 'Driver App - Touch up the design (light mode and dark mode)', '<ul><li><p>Consistent components/widgets like popups and photo viewers</p></li><li><p>consistent color scheme.</p></li><li><p>looks good in lite mode and dark mode</p></li></ul><p></p>', 'completed', 0, false, '43f82f56-f6e2-4400-aeb2-7c5195c557ad', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-07-20 20:11:58.35+00', '2026-07-29 13:13:05.271927+00', NULL),
	('dbf7d9ec-ef4f-4be4-9cff-756abae94b4f', '438f4c13-7bbf-4dbf-bc85-ee6f86d02bbb', NULL, 'DO THIS AFTER MOBILE APP "Do You Want To Be Notified?" prompt when', '<p>When an admin sends a message to a group that they are not subscribed to, a pop up should ask "Do you want to be notified if you get a response?" and if yes then join the group if no then just close the popup. should send the message either way</p>', 'to_do', 0, false, '43f82f56-f6e2-4400-aeb2-7c5195c557ad', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-07-13 13:34:56.381+00', NULL, '2026-07-29 13:16:30.923+00'),
	('e35f61ba-5402-4b1e-846c-a04ce5887517', '971bd9a8-2a95-44b8-b870-b862309e8417', NULL, 'Assign USD stripe account to usd quickbooks connection.', '<p>all USD customers (events located in the states) will need to pay money into the USD Stripe account. So we should setup each stripe account with each qbo connection. Multiple Sales Offices in the states. But we only need one. Everything can be from florida.</p>', 'completed', 0, true, '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-06-30 19:10:50.318+00', '2026-07-29 18:06:09.126847+00', NULL),
	('41331adb-689e-4147-b60c-230fe54cd08a', '971bd9a8-2a95-44b8-b870-b862309e8417', NULL, 'Display Distance Tooltip', '<p>Tooltip that shows the distance between the last location and the next location instead of the address tooltip.</p>', 'completed', 0, true, '43f82f56-f6e2-4400-aeb2-7c5195c557ad', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-06-30 13:47:27.462+00', '2026-08-03 14:51:30.516086+00', NULL),
